---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {radar,href} from '../lib/data';
---
<Layout title="Data and method"><article class="reading"><p class="eyebrow">DATA / PROVENANCE</p><h1>Data &amp; method</h1><h2>Historical import</h2><dl class="facts"><div><dt>Workbook observations</dt><dd>{radar.provenance.importedRows}</dd></div><div><dt>Legacy JSON observations</dt><dd>{radar.provenance.legacyCount}</dd></div><div><dt>Additional workbook rows</dt><dd>{radar.provenance.additionalRows}</dd></div><div><dt>Latest observation</dt><dd>{radar.asOf}</dd></div><div><dt>Schema version</dt><dd>{radar.schemaVersion}</dd></div><div><dt>Derivation</dt><dd>{radar.provenance.derivationVersion}</dd></div></dl><h2>Public fields</h2><p>Original title, source name, source type, actor label, stage label, observation date, URL and workbook row reference.</p><p>Titles and labels are historical tracker entries attributed to their linked sources. They are not presented as verified quotations or current findings.</p><h2>Excluded fields</h2><p>Generated summaries, “why it matters” commentary, confidence and relevance scores, research notes, digest text, discovery candidates and private raw records are excluded.</p><h2>Grouping and ordering</h2><p>Observations default to newest observed date. Stage and source-type filters use original labels. Actor and source directories group exact labels; no aliases, persona scores or rankings are inferred. Radar point positions separate records visually and carry no additional meaning.</p><h2>Reproducibility</h2><p>The public dataset is generated from a field-allowlisted historical input. ArkType validates the input before export. Stable identifiers, ordered exports and original file hashes preserve the import boundary. Repeated source URLs remain separate observations when their date, title or stage differs.</p><dl class="hashes"><dt>Workbook SHA-256</dt><dd>{radar.provenance.workbookSha256}</dd><dt>Legacy JSON SHA-256</dt><dd>{radar.provenance.legacySnapshotSha256}</dd><dt>Native platform revision</dt><dd>{radar.provenance.sourceRevision}</dd></dl><h2>Missing dates</h2><p>Unknown observed dates are displayed as Unknown. No date is inferred from another field. First-surfaced or publication dates are not included in this edition.</p><h2>Downloads</h2><ul><li><a href={href('exports/reconciliation.json')}>Workbook versus legacy row comparison · JSON</a></li><li><a href={href('exports/radar.json')}>Dataset and provenance · JSON</a></li><li><a href={href('exports/signals.csv')}>Observations · CSV</a></li><li><a href={href('exports/history.json')}>Observation-date history · JSON</a></li></ul><h2>Attribution and reuse</h2><p>Software: MIT. Source titles and source material remain attributed to their original publishers. The software license does not relicense linked third-party content.</p></article></Layout>
